    {
      "id": "claim_515dd7b1341645abbae49058292474a4",
      "statement": "mcp-shared's trust boundary is tools.ts: ServerTrust is deployment-decided (vetted = administrator-vouched annotations may drive auto-approval, producible only by the portal via MCP_PORTAL_TRUST_ANNOTATIONS; byo = user-typed URL where readOnlyHint only classifies reads and can never auto-apply a write), and classification marks readOnlyHint===true tools as observations while everything else queues for approval, with auto-applied writes additionally requiring a vetted endpoint plus destructiveHint===false and idempotentHint===true, all tested with strict equality so unannotated tools always land as non-auto-approvable actions.",
